1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,015
Hello, it's Clara from the museum.

2
00:00:02,965 --> 00:00:05,412
I'm calling about the exhibition.

3
00:00:05,412 --> 00:00:08,548
Could you pick up the leather bag from my office?

4
00:00:08,548 --> 00:00:12,180
You'll find it beside the window, not under the desk.

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:15,343
Please don't throw out the envelope inside it.

6
00:00:15,343 --> 00:00:18,457
I'd also like you to bring the wireless speaker.

7
00:00:18,457 --> 00:00:22,154
It runs on batteries, so we won't need a socket.

8
00:00:22,154 --> 00:00:27,593
I was testing it when the lights went out, but I had already saved all the recordings.

9
00:00:27,593 --> 00:00:30,144
Could you call me back when you arrive?

10
00:00:30,144 --> 00:00:31,702
Thanks so much.

